What's the possibility of the Rodan
 reacting to that song back at Misakioku?

00:02:19.160 --> 00:02:22.290
Assuming that's the case, 
they would be the ones who called the Rodan in.

00:02:19.160 --> 00:02:22.290
All of the Rodan were confirmed dead soon after.

00:02:22.740 --> 00:02:25.910
The bigger type of Rodan have been 
discovered in other places besides Nigashio.

00:02:26.460 --> 00:02:29.880
Also, why did that flock only storm in <i>now?</i>

00:02:29.880 --> 00:02:32.510
We haven't picked up that song since the other day.

00:02:32.510 --> 00:02:36.140
What do Misakioku stand to gain 
by calling them in, for starters?

00:02:36.470 --> 00:02:38.950
You have a point, but aren't you curious?

00:02:41.940 --> 00:02:43.560
Shall we set them up?

00:02:43.560 --> 00:02:47.750
To celebrate the achievement of drawing 
the Rodan out of town and saving civilians,

00:02:47.750 --> 00:02:51.900
a letter of appreciation has been 
granted to Outaki Goro at Outaki Factory.

