00:20:22.030 --> 00:20:25.620
And that is because it breaks the law of physics.

00:20:25.620 --> 00:20:28.000
A material that cannot exist in this world...

00:20:30.710 --> 00:20:32.250
If that's true,

00:20:32.250 --> 00:20:36.630
maybe Archetype was made in 
a world that's not our own.

00:20:36.630 --> 00:20:39.630
Are there any left alive to warrant us being on Rodan alert?

00:20:39.960 --> 00:20:41.300
You didn't hear about it?

00:20:41.300 --> 00:20:45.770
Yesterday, one of the Rodan came 
back to life while it was getting disposed

00:20:45.770 --> 00:20:46.640
Seriously?

00:20:46.640 --> 00:20:51.080
The other personnel nearby took care of it, 
but any later and he would have been...

00:20:52.150 --> 00:20:54.520
Tanaka, Suzuki. Get off here.

00:20:54.520 --> 00:20:57.790
A civilian minitruck overturned just ahead. Take a look.

00:20:57.790 --> 00:21:00.910
Rodan may have been involved. Stay vigilant.

00:21:03.360 --> 00:21:05.260
00 to 01.

00:21:05.260 --> 00:21:08.160
A civilian minitruck overturned just ahead.

00:21:16.170 --> 00:21:17.580
All clear.

00:21:18.750 --> 00:21:20.470
Is anyone there?

00:21:20.470 --> 00:21:21.730
Hey!

00:21:27.430 --> 00:21:30.690
We found the two civilians who were likely inside the vehicle.

00:21:31.600 --> 00:21:33.130
Are you hurt anywhere?

00:21:37.870 --> 00:21:38.690
Rodan!?

00:21:58.840 --> 00:21:59.980
Gunfire?

00:22:01.200 --> 00:22:04.020
Fully automatic. It's a sub-machine gun.

00:22:06.650 --> 00:22:12.400
<b>I woke up to your voice that painted my vision with color</b>

00:22:12.400 --> 00:22:18.280
<b>And it was the same shade of curiosity I find in my familiar daily life</b>

00:22:18.280 --> 00:22:23.660
<b>If this feeling can grow naturally on its own</b>

00:22:23.660 --> 00:22:29.540
<b>Will it fall off one day like an unripe fruit, I wonder? </b>

00:22:30.210 --> 00:22:34.170
<b>I don't know anything</b>

00:22:34.170 --> 00:22:38.550
<b>Not even anything about you</b>

00:22:41.430 --> 00:22:47.060
<b>Let me keep on dreaming for now</b>

00:22:47.060 --> 00:22:51.440
<b>If this moment is all I have now</b>

00:22:51.900 --> 00:22:55.900
<b>I can still feel the warmth in my palm</b>

00:22:57.740 --> 00:23:03.160
<b>My thrumming feelings open and burst out</b>

00:23:03.160 --> 00:23:07.170
<b>I want to keep learning more, like I am now</b>

00:23:08.920 --> 00:23:13.710
<b>This pulsating rhythm I feel just won't stop</b>

00:23:13.710 --> 00:23:14.670
<b>It won't stop</b>
